CHUNIN EXAM — DEBRIEF (COMPLETED)
Konohagakure, joint exam hosted with allied villages

Overview: The Chunin Selection Exams test genin from allied villages for
promotion to chunin. The exam proceeded in three stages: a written test, a
survival phase in the Forest of Death, and one-on-one tournament matches
before the daimyo and Kage.

Konoha Participation Notes:
- Team 7 (Naruto, Sasuke, Sakura) advanced through the Forest of Death
  despite an unauthorized interference incident (see classified security
  matter — Sound involvement).
- Multiple Konoha genin reached the tournament round; several demonstrated
  chunin-level tactical judgment.

Security Incident: The exam was disrupted by the joint Sound-Sand assault
that became the Konoha Crush (see separate incident report). Promotions
were adjudicated afterward on demonstrated merit rather than final rounds.

Recommendation: Tighten host-village security screening for future exams.
Filed by the exam proctor board.
